ク","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c37791"},"originalCharacterName":"ハク","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of the story."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Finding himself collapsed in the middle of nowhere with barely any clothes on his back, he was rescued by Kuon and given a name."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Having lost his memories: his real identity is a mystery."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Neither hard-working nor earnest, his quick thinking is this young man's biggest asset."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His complete lack of physical strength greatly worries Kuon."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c37791"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/18/187026aa1fd0442bec81d3d8aba943e89ca337da048eb28e74669f392f941cf0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9cad95bb85a7c567146d3a590e4f672009b27a09dbee2934796814cc7009c6ea.webp","width":214,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c37794","characterName":"ウコン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c37794"},"originalCharacterName":"ウコン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A traveler and mercenary captain Haku and Kuon encounter in a remote Kujyuri village."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While rough around the edges and a little boisterous, he commands immense respect from his men, and is currently contracted to escort a caravan of offerings to the Imperial Capital. He is also Nekone's older brother."},{"spoiler":fa